OL,3,GNEWSARichness of Japanese culture in
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland celebrated
OL,5,
OL,6,FA day of vibrant music, song and dance
OL,7,Fhas been held to celebrate the richness
OL,8,Fof Japanese culture in Northern
OL,9,FIreland.
OL,11,FThe 30th anniversary of the Japan
OL,12,FSociety in Northern Ireland was marked
OL,13,Fwith a family-friendly matsuri festival
OL,14,Fthat featured performances, workshops,
OL,15,Fdemonstrations and activities.
OL,17,FThe Japanese Ambassador to the UK, and
OL,18,Fsocial media personality, Hiroshi
OL,19,FSuzuki was in attendance and said he
OL,20,Fwas excited to be there.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
