OL,3,GNEWSARichness of Japanese culture in
OL,4,ANorthern Ireland celebrated
OL,5,
OL,6,F"For me this is extremely important `
OL,7,Fbecause there are a number of Japanese
OL,8,Fcompanies invested and operating in and
OL,9,Faround Belfast in Northern Ireland `
OL,10,Fand we have a mutually beneficial
OL,11,Feconomic partnership," he said.
